"bmi270-ds000.pdf>`_ 에 있습니다."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-giga-r1-wifi.rst:488
msgid "RGB LED (Display Shield)"
msgstr "RGB LED (Display Shield)"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-giga-r1-wifi.rst:490
msgid ""
"The Arduino Giga Display Shield carries an on‑board RGB LED driven by an "
"ISSI **IS31FL3197** 3‑channel LED driver on the same I²C 4 bus. The driver's"
