#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-giga-r1-wifi.rst:542
msgid "Bus reference"
msgstr "버스 레퍼런스"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-giga-r1-wifi.rst:547
msgid ""
"Use :ref:`machine.Pin <machine.Pin>` to read or drive any of the "
"silkscreened pins. Outputs are 3.3 V CMOS and can sink/source up to 20 mA "
