#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-giga-r1-wifi.rst:828
msgid "**AMG8833** — 8 × 8 IR array"
msgstr "**AMG8833** — 8 × 8 IR 어레이"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-giga-r1-wifi.rst:830
msgid ""
"Wire the module to the board's I²C bus and read frames with ``fir.init()`` +"
